<section class="legal-shell">
  <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <h4>On this page</h4>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#introduction"><span class="toc-num">01</span> Introduction</a></li>
      <li><a href="#information-we-collect"><span class="toc-num">02</span> Information We Collect</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how-we-use-information"><span class="toc-num">03</span> How We Use It</a></li>
      <li><a href="#legal-basis"><span class="toc-num">04</span> Legal Basis</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sharing-information"><span class="toc-num">05</span> Sharing Your Data</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cookies"><span class="toc-num">06</span> Cookies & Tracking</a></li>
      <li><a href="#data-retention"><span class="toc-num">07</span> Data Retention</a></li>
      <li><a href="#data-security"><span class="toc-num">08</span> Data Security</a></li>
      <li><a href="#your-rights"><span class="toc-num">09</span> Your Rights</a></li>
      <li><a href="#childrens-privacy"><span class="toc-num">10</span> Children's Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#international-transfers"><span class="toc-num">11</span> International Transfers</a></li>
      <li><a href="#third-party-links"><span class="toc-num">12</span> Third-Party Links</a></li>
      <li><a href="#changes"><span class="toc-num">13</span> Changes to This Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="toc-num">14</span> Contact & Grievance Officer</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <div class="legal-content">

    <div class="legal-section" id="introduction">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">01</span> Introduction</h2>
      <p>Roovia ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This Policy describes how we collect, use, share, and protect personal data when you use our website, app, or services as a Guest, Host, or visitor.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="information-we-collect">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">02</span> Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li><strong>Account information</strong> — name, email, phone number, profile photo, and password.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking information</strong> — stay dates, Listings viewed or booked, guest count, and special requests.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment information</strong> — processed by Razorpay; Roovia receives only transaction status and amount, not full card details.</li>
        <li><strong>Listing information</strong> (Hosts) — property address, photos, amenities, and payout bank details.</li>
        <li><strong>Device & usage data</strong> — IP address, browser type, pages visited, and approximate location.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies</strong> — used for session management, preferences, and analytics.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="how-we-use-information">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">03</span> How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>To create and manage your account, and process bookings and payouts.</li>
        <li>To connect Guests and Hosts and facilitate communication between them.</li>
        <li>To send booking confirmations, receipts, and important service updates.</li>
        <li>To detect fraud, enforce our Terms, and keep the Platform safe.</li>
        <li>To improve the Platform through aggregated, non-identifying analytics.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="legal-basis">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">04</span> Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <p>We process personal data to perform our contract with you (fulfilling bookings), to comply with legal obligations (tax and payment records), and based on your consent where required — such as marketing communications, which you can opt out of at any time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="sharing-information">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">05</span> Sharing Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li><strong>Between Guests and Hosts</strong> — limited booking details needed to complete a stay (name, contact info, dates).</li>
        <li><strong>Payment processors</strong> — Razorpay, to process payments and payouts securely.</li>
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> — hosting, email, and analytics providers who process data on our behalf under confidentiality obligations.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal authorities</strong> — where required by law, court order, or to protect the rights and safety of our users.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Roovia does not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="cookies">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">06</span> Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>We use cookies to keep you logged in, remember your preferences, and understand how the Platform is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings, though disabling essential cookies may affect Platform functionality.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="data-retention">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">07</span> Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain account and booking data for as long as your account is active, and for a reasonable period afterward to comply with tax, accounting, and legal obligations. You may request earlier deletion, subject to these requirements.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="data-security">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">08</span> Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard safeguards — including encryption in transit, access controls, and secure payment processing through Razorpay — to protect your data. No system is completely secure, and we encourage you to use a strong, unique password.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="your-rights">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">09</span> Your Rights & Choices</h2>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Access and review the personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate or outdated account information.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your account and associated data, subject to legal retention requirements.</li>
        <li>Opt out of marketing emails at any time using the unsubscribe link.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="legal-callout">To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <strong>hello@roovia.com</strong> — we'll respond within a reasonable time.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="childrens-privacy">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">10</span> Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Roovia is not intended for use by anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you believe a child has provided us data, contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="international-transfers">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">11</span> International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>Your data is primarily stored and processed in India. Where data is transferred internationally (for example, via a service provider's servers), we take reasonable steps to ensure it remains protected consistent with this Policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="third-party-links">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">12</span> Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>The Platform may link to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites, and encourage you to review their policies separately.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="changes">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">13</span> Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Material changes will be communicated via email or an in-app notice, along with an updated "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section" id="contact">
      <h2><span class="legal-num">14</span> Contact & Grievance Officer</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions or complaints, contact us at <strong>hello@roovia.com</strong>. In accordance with applicable Indian IT rules, grievances may also be addressed to our designated Grievance Officer via the same address, and we aim to acknowledge complaints within 24 hours and resolve them within 15 days.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
</main>

<script>
(function () {
  const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.legal-section[id]');
  const tocLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.legal-toc a');
  const NAV_OFFSET = 110; // matches scroll-margin-top

  // Intercept TOC clicks: scroll manually, don't touch the URL hash
  tocLinks.forEach((link) => {
    link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const id = link.getAttribute('href').slice(1);
      const target = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!target) return;

      const top = target.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.pageYOffset - NAV_OFFSET;
      window.scrollTo({ top, behavior: 'smooth' });

      // Optional: reflect the section in the URL without triggering a jump
      history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + id);
    });
  });

  // If the page loads with a hash in the URL (e.g. from a bookmark/shared link),
  // strip it so a refresh always starts at the top instead of jumping down.
  if (window.location.hash) {
    history.replaceState(null, '', window.location.pathname + window.location.search);
    window.scrollTo(0, 0);
  }

  // Scrollspy highlighting stays the same
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach((entry) => {
      const link = document.querySelector('.legal-toc a[href="#' + entry.target.id + '"]');
      if (!link) return;
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        tocLinks.forEach((l) => l.classList.remove('active'));
        link.classList.add('active');
      }
    });
  }, {
    rootMargin: '-110px 0px -70% 0px',
    threshold: 0
  });

  sections.forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
})();
</script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>